{"symbol":"BONDADA","yahoo":"BONDADA.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Bondada Engineering Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","website":"https://www.bondada.net","about":"Bondada Engineering Limited provides engineering, procurement, construction, and operations and maintenance services for telecom and solar sectors in India. It also engages in design, procurement, construction, and commissioning of solar project; planning, upgradation, construction, and installation of telecommunications infrastructure, such as monopoles, guyed towers, and lattice towers; railway infrastructure; and data centers maintenance. In addition, the company provides Autoclaved Aerated Concrete blocks under the SmartBrix brand name; uPVC window and door systems under the truVU brand; and aluminium windows and doors under AluRise brand name. Further, it offers tower pole supplies, LED lights, and EV and drone motors; and manufactures and supplies telecom, and transmission and distribution towers. Bondada Engineering Limited was incorporated in 2012 and is headquartered in Hyderabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:13:25+00:00","quote":{"price":277.3,"prevClose":273.4,"marketCap":3096.64,"high52":503.0,"low52":216.0,"pe":14.21,"bookValue":62.19,"dividendRate":0.28,"roe":34.93,"shares":11.1671,"insiders":70.5,"institutions":0.04},"prices":{"dates":["2023-08-30","2023-08-31","2023-09-01","2023-09-04","2023-09-05","2023-09-06","2023-09-07","2023-09-08","2023-09-11","2023-09-12","2023-09-13","2023-09-14","2023-09-15","2023-09-18","2023-09-20","2023-09-21","2023-09-22","2023-09-25","2023-09-26","2023-09-27","2023-09-28","2023-09-29","2023-10-03","2023-10-04","2023-10-05","2023-10-06","2023-10-09","2023-10-10","2023-10-11","2023-10-12","2023-10-13","2023-10-16","2023-10-17","2023-10-18","2023-10-19","2023-10-20","2023-10-23","2023-10-25","2023-10-26","2023-10-27","2023-10-30","2023-10-31","2023-11-01","2023-11-02","2023-11-03","2023-11-06","2023-11-07","2023-1